\n  onTextDelta?: (delta: string, messageId: string) => void;\n  onError?: (error: Error) => void;\n}\n```\n\n**2. MastraWorkflowAgent で callbacks を作成・注入**\n\n```typescript\n// agents/MastraWorkflowAgent.ts\nclass MastraWorkflowAgent implements Agent {\n  async run(input: AgentInput, events: EventEmitter) {\n    const messageId = `msg_${Date.now()}`;\n    \n    // AG-UI イベントを emit する callbacks を作成\n    const callbacks: WorkflowCallbacks = {\n      onToolCallStart: (toolName, args, toolCallId) => {\n        events.emit(EventType.TOOL_CALL_START, {\n          toolCallId,\n          toolCallName: toolName,\n          toolCallArgs: JSON.stringify(args),\n        });\n      },\n      onToolCallEnd: (toolName, result, toolCallId) => {\n        events.emit(EventType.TOOL_CALL_END, {\n          toolCallId,\n          toolCallName: toolName,\n          toolCallResult: JSON.stringify(result),\n        });\n      },\n      onTextDelta: (delta) => {\n        events.emit(EventType.TEXT_MESSAGE_CONTENT, {\n          messageId,\n          delta,\n        });\n      },\n    };\n    \n    // Client tools は「実行」だけ担当（イベント emit しない）\n    const clientTools = convertClientToolsForExecution(\n      input.tools, \n      this.session\n    );\n    \n    // Workflow に callbacks を渡す\n    const run = await this.workflow.createRun();\n    const stream = await run.stream({\n      inputData: {\n        messages: input.messages,\n        clientTools,\n        callbacks, // ← これがポイント\n      },\n    });\n    \n    for await (const chunk of stream.fullStream) {\n      // workflow レベルのイベント処理\n    }\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**3. Workflow Step で callbacks を使う**\n\n```typescript\n// workflows/support-workflow.ts\nconst agentStep = createStep({\n  id: 'agent-response',\n  inputSchema: z.object({\n    messages: z.array(messageSchema),\n    clientTools: z.record(z.string(), z.any()).optional(),\n    callbacks: z.any(), // WorkflowCallbacks\n  }),\n  execute: async ({ inputData, mastra }) => {\n    const { messages, clientTools, callbacks } = inputData;\n    const agent = mastra?.getAgent('support-agent');\n    \n    // Backend tools (MCP等) は Agent 定義済み\n    // Client tools は追加\n    const stream = await agent!.stream(messages, {\n      toolsets: clientTools,\n      \n      // すべてのツールイベントが onChunk を通る\n      onChunk: (chunk) => {\n        switch (chunk.type) {\n          case 'tool-call':\n            callbacks?.onToolCallStart?.(\n              chunk.payload.toolName,\n              chunk.payload.args,\n              chunk.payload.toolCallId\n            );\n            break;\n          case 'tool-result':\n            callbacks?.onToolCallEnd?.(\n              chunk.payload.toolName,\n              chunk.payload.result,\n              chunk.payload.toolCallId\n            );\n            break;\n          case 'text-delta':\n            callbacks?.onTextDelta?.(chunk.payload.text, chunk.payload.id);\n            break;\n        }\n      },\n    });\n    \n    return { reply: await stream.text };\n  },\n});\n```\n\n**4. Client Tools は実行のみ（emit しない）**\n\n```typescript\n// utils/clientToolConverter.ts\nexport function convertClientToolsForExecution(\n  tools: ToolDefinition[],\n  session: ClientSession\n): Record<string, CoreTool> {\n  return Object.fromEntries(\n    tools.map((toolDef) => [\n      toolDef.name,\n      tool({\n        description: toolDef.description,\n        parameters: jsonSchema(toolDef.parameters),\n        execute: async (args) => {\n          // Socket 通信だけ。AG-UI emit は onChunk が担当\n          return await executeOnClient(toolDef.name, args, session);\n        },\n      }),\n    ])\n  );\n}\n```\n\n## メリット\n\n| 項目 | 説明 |\n|------|------|\n| **統一されたイベントフロー** | MCP も Client も同じ `onChunk` → `callbacks` → AG-UI |\n| **二重 emit なし** | イベント発生源が一箇所に集約 |\n| **ツール定義に依存しない** | ツールをラップする必要がない |\n| **拡張性** | 新しい callback を追加すれば他のイベントも対応可能 |\n\n## 考慮点\n\n1. **Client tool の結果待ち**: `execute` 内で Socket 応答を待つ仕組みは依然必要\n2. **callbacks の型安全性**: `z.any()` より良い型定義ができると良い\n3. **エラーハンドリング**: `onError` callback でエラーも統一的に扱える\n\nこの方向で進めますか？",
